  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>水都之城</strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>這是一張從零開始打造的地圖，處處充滿精緻細節與大型建築。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>你可以盡情探索，或與朋友開啟全新冒險，絕不擔心空間不足。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>目前仍在開發中，但所有內容都已完工且無縫銜接。</span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地圖：</span></strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>以下為目前已完成的地圖圖片，並附有新手引導區域，助你順利展開探索。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8c01bf8b-af2f-4b66-a45b-df6be5acbb8c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_11c741e0-e545-48b2-8eaa-2ca06159b03d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_58a310b4-f22d-47d9-9ad7-f95f61f7a652.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_203450a1-ad3b-4c06-9500-2242349df8bc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a9476484-0517-4204-a92a-6c68f7f020d4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_314e376d-a418-4380-a4ba-369217755895.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2d455bb0-5b10-4790-a709-b7eef66b603f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b3285af9-550d-4c56-a110-bb81e7f96af7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dca90aae-42eb-432f-b317-98ac5a3545e6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>更新日誌</span></strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>所有現有項目完成後，將會陸續推出新更新。</span></p>",
